\.TH BAD-DECISIONS 1 "2026-09-24" "Bad Decisions 1.3.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
bad-decisions \- deal, validate, import, and inspect Bad Decisions card packs
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bad-decisions
.RI [ options ]
.br
.B bad-decisions pack
.RI {validate|export|import|init-registry} ...
.br
.B bad-decisions consequences
.RI {report|tui|rebuild|purge} ...
.br
.B bad-decisions
.RI {setup|serve|deploy|status|reload|stop} ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B bad-decisions
is the command-line engine and service toolkit for portable card-deck packs. With no subcommand it deals an interactive round. It can also produce one-shot output, stream rounds, manage .carddeck archives, and inspect the local Consequences analytics database.
.PP
An omitted pack selector means every pack in the loaded registry. Set BAD_DECISIONS_PACK_DIR to use a custom registry.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR --oneshot
Print one rendered round and exit.
.TP
.BR --rapid
Continuously print rendered rounds.
.TP
.BI --delay seconds
Delay between rapid rounds. Must be positive and finite.
.TP
.BI --packs ids
Comma-separated pack IDs for both card colors.
.TP
.BI --black-packs ids
Override the black-card selector.
.TP
.BI --white-packs ids
Override the white-card selector.
.TP
.BR --list-packs
List available packs and exit.
.SH PACK COMMANDS
.TP
.BI pack validate archive
Validate a .carddeck archive without changing disk.
.TP
.BI pack export pack-id archive
Export a registered pack to an archive.
.TP
.BI pack import archive registry-dir
Import an archive into an absolute registry directory. Use --remote for an HTTPS archive or --index for a remote catalog; --pack may be repeated with --index.
.TP
.BI pack init-registry registry-dir
Initialize an absolute registry with bundled packs.
.SH CONSEQUENCES COMMANDS
.TP
.BI consequences report [database]
Print aggregate analytics as JSON. If database is omitted, use BAD_DECISIONS_CONSEQUENCES_DB or the installed release database.
.TP
.BI consequences tui [database]
Open the read-only Textual dashboard. It provides dashboard, combination, prompt, and recent-draw views; press d, c, p, or r to switch views and q to quit. Textual is included in the core package.
.TP
.BI consequences rebuild database
Rebuild aggregate counters. Requires an explicit absolute database path.
.TP
.BI consequences purge database --retention-days days
Purge retained records and rebuild counters.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B BAD_DECISIONS_PACK_DIR
Replace the bundled pack registry.
.TP
.B BAD_DECISIONS_CONSEQUENCES_DB
Absolute path to the Consequences SQLite database.
.TP
.B BAD_DECISIONS_CONSEQUENCES_RECORDING
Enable or disable server-side Consequences recording.
.TP
.B BAD_DECISIONS_CONSEQUENCES_FEEDBACK
Enable or disable voting while retaining server analytics.
.TP
.B BAD_DECISIONS_CONSEQUENCES_PUBLIC_STATS
Enable public combination summaries.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /var/lib/bad-decisions/consequences.sqlite3
Typical service database location.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
Configuration or operational failure.
.TP
.B 2
Invalid request or domain error.
